# stage0 of the fixpoint chain: the release `pnpm term:boot` fetches, verifies and builds stage1 and stage2 with. The
# site's image index digest is the trust anchor: term:boot refuses unless the registry serves exactly this index under
# the version tag, and stage0 is the term/host/compile.mjs its signed payload carries (decision 126)
boot
  code <2.10.0>
  site <oci://ghcr.io/cluesurf/term/code@sha256:9d1a690aaf63182301e03167790897ec7af44a3c90b355e8f51d46a638d21908>
